Hamiltonian Neural Networks (2019) spring reproduction

Independent audited port referring to Hamiltonian Neural Networks by
Sam Greydanus, Misko Dzamba, and Jason Yosinski.
Upstream: https://github.com/greydanus/hamiltonian-nn
Commit: bcc362235dc623ffe48f22ccc22417e02e9803b4
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0.

The runner has been independently reorganized and modified for portable paths,
explicit notebook mutation tracks, recorded data, metrics, plots and validation.
Fetched upstream source files, paper HTML and author figures are not bundled.
This is an independent reproduction, not an official author release.

This limited publication includes only the official spring track, source,
documentation, generated figures and aggregate metrics. Raw synthetic arrays,
checkpoints, paper-text convention supplements and later studies are excluded.
